        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Multi-image storyboard (Wan 2.2 Lightning)\n\n1. Drop photos on **Image 1 to Image 4** in story order.\n   Only have 2 photos? Duplicate them: 1=start, 2=start, 3=end, 4=end.\n2. Type what should happen in **Instructions**.\n3. **Run**. Three 5s clips are stitched (~15s at 16fps).\n\nThis is first-last-frame interpolation, not a collage. The model moves FROM one photo TOWARD the next while following the prompt."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    },
